{"v":1,"accession":"PRJEB35979","title":"Aerosol antibiotic resistance gene dissemination among hospital departments by culture-facilitated comparative metagenomics","description":"Genes make microorganisms resistant to antibiotics are overwhelmingly present in environments, and those in the air seem to consistently worsen human health, especially in built-in hospitals. In this study, we sampled two distinct seasonal solid-, liquid- and gaseous-state samples in a large occupied hospital, and mainly aim to study the temporal and spatial micro-ecology and antibiotic resistance gene (ARG) distribution patterns within hospital settings using culture-facilitated comparative metagenomics in combinations with other widely applied methods.","center":"xylab","data_type":"Other","submission_date":"2020/01/10 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMEA6436590","emergency hall summer","confirmed_urban","air_dust",null,2018,"CN",null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"China",null,null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMEA6436591","ophthalmology department summer","confirmed_urban","air_dust",null,2018,"CN",null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"China",null,null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMEA6436592","pediatrics department summer","confirmed_urban","air_dust",null,2018,"CN",null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"China",null,null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMEA6436593","emergency hall winter","confirmed_urban","air_dust",null,2019,"CN",null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"China",null,null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMEA6436594","emergency hall winter","confirmed_urban","air_dust",null,2019,"CN",null,null,null,"unresolved",null,nul